 ## Importing
 
-`make import` reads data/incoming/*.csv and logs to logs/import.log. Partners send their own date formats.
+`make import` reads data/incoming/*.csv and logs to logs/import.log. Partners send their own date formats,
+even within one file: the accepted ones are listed in `date_formats` in config/service.toml and are tried in order. A
+row whose date matches none of them stops the import (nothing of that file is committed); add its format there.
 
